Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:58:56 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] vkd3d-shader/dxil: SM 6.1-6.6 operations for wintomac

createHandleFromBinding/annotateHandle (all SM 6.6 shaders), [WaveSize(32)], pack4x8/unpack4x8,
dot4add_{i8,u8}packed, dot2add, SV_ViewID (always view 0: no view instancing).
